      "heading": "What a conveyor inspection is for",
      "html": "<p>Conveyors run all day, often alone. The danger sits in a few places. Trapping points. The emergency stop. The lock-off before work on the belt. The inspection checks all three.</p><p>Quickler does not make a conveyor safe. It makes the check quick, and a missing guard is logged and flagged, not walked past.</p>"
